# Font binaries (src/app/fonts/files/, added in ADR 0032) must never go
# through line-ending conversion — a CRLF rewrite would corrupt them.
# Git's own content-sniffing already skips binary files in practice, but
# it still prints a conversion warning for them on Windows without this,
# and silence here is safer than relying on the sniff every time.
*.woff2 binary
*.woff binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.eot binary
